     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Combat is built as an obstacle course. Children work through a climbing wall, monkey bars, hanging rings and bridges, then finish on a red slide. It suits older children who want a challenge, and it works for timed races at school sports days. The structure takes 30 to 35 children, has a product area of 30'2\" x 21'2\" and a safe play area of 36'2\" x 27'2\". Combat lists confidence building, problem solving, creative thinking and strength among its skills. It comes in a multi-colour finish as part of our NexLev Escapade series. Warranty on the pipe frame, the moulded and laminate parts and the play rope runs for 3 years. Send us your plot size and the ages you plan for."
     }
    ]
